<body>

<h1 class="main-title">Farm Animal Demonstration</h1>

<div class="meta-field"><span class="meta-label">Title:</span> Farm Animal Details using Classes and Objects</div>

<div class="meta-field"><span class="meta-label">Objective/Aim:</span><br>
To write a Java program to create farm animal objects and display their name, place, food, and sound using a constructor and method.</div>

<h2 class="section-header">System Requirements :</h2>
<div class="sub-heading">Hardware</div>
<ul>
<li>Standard PC/Laptop</li><li>Intel Core i3/i5 processor or equivalent</li><li>Minimum 4 GB RAM</li><li>Minimum 500 MB free storage</li><li>Keyboard and Monitor</li>
</ul>
<div class="sub-heading">Software</div>
<ul>
<li>Operating System: Windows/Linux/macOS</li><li>Java Development Kit (JDK 17 or JDK 21)</li>
<li>Text Editor or IDE such as Eclipse, IntelliJ IDEA, NetBeans, or VS Code</li><li>Command Prompt/Terminal</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="section-header">Algorithm / Logic Description:</h2>
<ol>
<li>Create a class named <code>FarmAnimal</code>.</li>
<li>Define instance variables:
<ul>
<li><code>animalName</code> : Name of the animal (String)</li>
<li><code>animalPlace</code> : Place where the animal stays (String)</li>
<li><code>animalFood</code> : Food consumed by the animal (String)</li>
<li><code>animalSound</code> : Sound produced by the animal (String)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Create a parameterized constructor to initialize all animal fields.</li>
<li>Define a <code>showDetails()</code> method to print all animal attributes in a formatted layout.</li>
<li>Create the <code>FarmAnimalDemo</code> class containing the <code>main()</code> method.</li>
<li>Instantiate three <code>FarmAnimal</code> objects:
<ul>
<li><code>cow</code>: ("Cow", "Cowshed", "Grass", "Moo")</li>
<li><code>pig</code>: ("Pig", "Pigsty", "Vegetables", "Oink")</li>
<li><code>horse</code>: ("Horse", "Stable", "Grass", "Neigh")</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Call <code>showDetails()</code> on each animal object to display their respective details.</li>
<li>Stop the program.</li>
</ol>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<h2 class="section-header">UML class Diagram</h2>

<div class="uml-box">
<div class="uml-class-header">FarmAnimal</div>
<div class="uml-attributes">
